{"ID":"20240205153707-yhy1wy8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153707-yhy1wy8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153707-yhy1wy8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163428-6rfplr4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616085546-eqjnxdb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5130,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163428-6rfplr4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"027牛膝","type":"doc","updated":"20240802083222"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205163428-6rfplr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163428-6rfplr4","updated":"20240618123720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"怀牛膝"}]},{"ID":"20240206091216-f1an4wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091216-f1an4wa","updated":"20240206091220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、山东、山西等地。\n【性状】\t根呈细长圆柱形，有的稍弯曲，上端稍粗，下端较细，长1550cm，直径0.41cm。表面及黄色或淡棕色，具细微纵皱纹，有细小横长皮孔及稀疏的细根痕。质硬而脆，易折断，断面平坦，黄棕色，微呈角质样，中心维管束木部较大，黄白色，其外围散有多数点状维管束，排列成2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4轮。气微，味微甜、涩。\n【性味】\t味苦；酸；性平。\n【功效】\t补肝肾；强筋骨；活血通经；引火 (血) 下行；利尿通淋。主治腰膝酸痛；下肢痿软；血滞经闭；痛经；产后血瘀腹痛；症瘕；胞衣不下；热淋；血淋；跌打损伤；痈肿恶疮；咽喉肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091210-id6woy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091210-id6woy3","updated":"20240206091210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091210-267old2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163435-lef426r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"202402051